<urn:atm:triage:finding/S8-QA2-005>
  a triage:Finding ;
  triage:findingId "S8-QA2-005" ;
  triage:title "No test for bare '~' tilde expansion (sprint-S8.md task 5.1)" ;
  triage:description "sprint-S8.md task 5.1 states tilde expansion applies to leading '~', '~/', and '~\\'. Tests cover '~/hooks/notify.sh' (Unix) and '~\\hooks\\notify.cmd' (Windows) but not the bare '~' case alone (resolving to home directory). Add normalize_post_send_hooks_expands_bare_home_tilde: pass command = [\"~\"] and assert result equals home::user_home().expect(\"home\").display().to_string()." ;
